      "text": "A Guide to Apache Kafka Protocol",
      "version": 1068,
      "autoResize": true,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "b9t",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A Guide to Apache Kafka Protocol",
      "height": 35,
      "link": "https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/A+Guide+To+The+Kafka+Protocol#AGuideToTheKafkaProtocol-Requests",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "groupIds": [],
      "versionNonce": 1285959992,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "x": -3551.7914888625382,
      "angle": 0,
      "y": 549.2485513220086,
      "width": 472.5557861328125
    },
    {
      "seed": 585260517,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "id": "k-AwuA_x5YDVCg7BhhvJL",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "opacity": 100,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1778283640683,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RecordBatch =>\n  FirstOffset => int64\n  Length => int32\n  PartitionLeaderEpoch => int32\n  Magic => int8 \n  CRC => int32\n  Attributes => int16\n    bit 0~2:\n        0: no compression\n        1: gzip\n        2: snappy\n        3: lz4\n        4: zstd\n    bit 3: timestampType\n    bit 4: isTransactional (0 means not transactional)\n    bit 5: isControlBatch (0 means not a control batch)\n    bit 6: hasDeleteHorizonMs (0 means baseTimestamp is not set as the delete horizon for compaction)\n    bit 7~15: unused\n  LastOffsetDelta => int32\n  FirstTimestamp => int64\n  MaxTimestamp => int64\n  ProducerId => int64\n  ProducerEpoch => int16\n  FirstSequence => int32\n  Records => [Record]\n\nRecord =>\n  Length => varint\n  Attributes => int8\n  TimestampDelta => varint\n  OffsetDelta => varint\n  KeyLen => varint\n  Key => data\n  ValueLen => varint\n  Value => data\n  Headers => [Header]\n\nHeader => HeaderKey HeaderVal\n  HeaderKeyLen => varint\n  HeaderKey => string\n  HeaderValueLen => varint\n  HeaderValue => data",
      "version": 1305,
      "autoResize": true,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "bAw",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RecordBatch =>\n  FirstOffset => int64\n  Length => int32\n  PartitionLeaderEpoch => int32\n  Magic => int8 \n  CRC => int32\n  Attributes => int16\n    bit 0~2:\n        0: no compression\n        1: gzip\n        2: snappy\n        3: lz4\n        4: zstd\n    bit 3: timestampType\n    bit 4: isTransactional (0 means not transactional)\n    bit 5: isControlBatch (0 means not a control batch)\n    bit 6: hasDeleteHorizonMs (0 means baseTimestamp is not set as the delete horizon for compaction)\n    bit 7~15: unused\n  LastOffsetDelta => int32\n  FirstTimestamp => int64\n  MaxTimestamp => int64\n  ProducerId => int64\n  ProducerEpoch => int16\n  FirstSequence => int32\n  Records => [Record]\n\nRecord =>\n  Length => varint\n  Attributes => int8\n  TimestampDelta => varint\n  OffsetDelta => varint\n  KeyLen => varint\n  Key => data\n  ValueLen => varint\n  Value => data\n  Headers => [Header]\n\nHeader => HeaderKey HeaderVal\n  HeaderKeyLen => varint\n  HeaderKey => string\n  HeaderValueLen => varint\n  HeaderValue => data",
      "height": 840,
      "link": null,
