    {
      "seed": 1430574977,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "id": "5690q300gtYQ-rXm43EBY",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "opacity": 100,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776724278514,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "before : minIsr= min.insync.replicas,  \nAfter : Kip-966  ISR.size >= effectiveMinIsr , where effectiveMinIsr = min(min.insync.replicas, RF) ",
      "version": 591,
      "autoResize": true,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "index": "ba5V",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "before : minIsr= min.insync.replicas,  \nAfter : Kip-966  ISR.size >= effectiveMinIsr , where effectiveMinIsr = min(min.insync.replicas, RF) ",
      "height": 40,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "groupIds": [
        "T8wIsr3UlQb9HUg-3-t-P"
      ],
      "versionNonce": 1489275720,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "x": 1198.3135515969632,
      "angle": 0,
      "y": 830.2401620676812,
      "width": 762.4473876953125
    },
    {
      "seed": 1202343329,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "id": "_ITGcyQpggqdtlJL6CfOC",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "opacity": 100,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776724278514,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ISR Shrinking :  Time-Based lag  ( Lag > 30s (default)) ((currentTime - lastCaughtUpTime) > replica.lag.time.max.ms (default: 30s))\nISR Expansion :  Time-Based Lag ( Follower LEO >=HW & Follower LEO >=LeaderEpochStartOffset )\nminISR calulation :  check above\nProducer Ack=-1 Validation :  ISR SIZE >=min.isr.  ( ISR SIZE>= effectiveMin in latest)\nHW :  min (LEOs of all replicas in ISR)\nConsumer : HWM only advances if ISR Size >= min.insync.replicas, If ISR drps below this threshold, HWM stops advancing and consumer cannot\n        read messages, even if porducers continue writing wiht lower durabliity settings. Prior to 3.7.0( HWM advancement is independent\n        of min ISR,  Consumer can read new messages even under min ISR)",
      "version": 1308,
      "autoResize": true,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "index": "ba5l",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ISR Shrinking :  Time-Based lag  ( Lag > 30s (default)) ((currentTime - lastCaughtUpTime) > replica.lag.time.max.ms (default: 30s))\nISR Expansion :  Time-Based Lag ( Follower LEO >=HW & Follower LEO >=LeaderEpochStartOffset )\nminISR calulation :  check above\nProducer Ack=-1 Validation :  ISR SIZE >=min.isr.  ( ISR SIZE>= effectiveMin in latest)\nHW :  min (LEOs of all replicas in ISR)\nConsumer : HWM only advances if ISR Size >= min.insync.replicas, If ISR drps below this threshold, HWM stops advancing and consumer cannot\n        read messages, even if porducers continue writing wiht lower durabliity settings. Prior to 3.7.0( HWM advancement is independent\n        of min ISR,  Consumer can read new messages even under min ISR)",
      "height": 160,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
