      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n CONSUMER Performance metrics\nfetch-latency-avg : Avg time taken for a fetch request\nfetch-size-avg : Avg number of bytes fetched per request\ncommit-latency-avg:  Avg Time commit request\nrebalance-latency-total : Total time taken for group rebalnaces\nfetch-throttle-time-avg: Avg throttel time \n\nConsume lag : records-lag-max\n\nConsumer throughput:  fetch-rate, fetch-latency-avg, fetch-\nlatency-max,  records-per-request-avg, bytes-consumed-rate\n\nTroubleShoot Rebalance issues:\n- Frequent rebalancing :  join-rate,  sync-rate\n- Long rebalancing time :  join-time-avg,  join-time-max,  sync-\ntime-avg,  sync-time-max",
      "version": 1171,
      "autoResize": true,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "index": "blb",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": "CYvrzuo9Q6TMnplSWUkND",
      "originalText": "\n CONSUMER Performance metrics\nfetch-latency-avg : Avg time taken for a fetch request\nfetch-size-avg : Avg number of bytes fetched per request\ncommit-latency-avg:  Avg Time commit request\nrebalance-latency-total : Total time taken for group rebalnaces\nfetch-throttle-time-avg: Avg throttel time \n\nConsume lag : records-lag-max\n\nConsumer throughput:  fetch-rate, fetch-latency-avg, fetch-latency-max,  records-per-request-avg, bytes-consumed-rate\n\nTroubleShoot Rebalance issues:\n- Frequent rebalancing :  join-rate,  sync-rate\n- Long rebalancing time :  join-time-avg,  join-time-max,  sync-time-avg,  sync-time-max",
