      "text": "\n Producer Performance metrics\nrecord-size-avg:  Avg record size\nbatch-size-avg: Avg number of bytes sent per partition per-request\nbufferpool-wait-ratio: Fraction of time an appender waits for space allocation\ncompression-rate-avg: Avg Compression rate for a topic. \nrecord-queue-time-avg: Avg time(ms) record batches spent in the send buffer\nrequest-latency-avg:  Avg request latency (ms)\nproduce-throttle-time-avg: Avg time(ms) a request was throttled by a broker\nrecord-retry-rate: Avg per-second number of retried record sends for a topc\n\nFor Troubleshooting :\n - ResponseRate,   RequestRate,   Request Latency avg,   Outgoing byte\nRate,  IO ratio & IO wait ratio,   Record retry & error rate",
      "version": 1902,
      "autoResize": true,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "index": "bld",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": "UkoElyjIUexidevsu60zq",
      "originalText": "\n Producer Performance metrics\nrecord-size-avg:  Avg record size\nbatch-size-avg: Avg number of bytes sent per partition per-request\nbufferpool-wait-ratio: Fraction of time an appender waits for space allocation\ncompression-rate-avg: Avg Compression rate for a topic. \nrecord-queue-time-avg: Avg time(ms) record batches spent in the send buffer\nrequest-latency-avg:  Avg request latency (ms)\nproduce-throttle-time-avg: Avg time(ms) a request was throttled by a broker\nrecord-retry-rate: Avg per-second number of retried record sends for a topc\n\nFor Troubleshooting :\n - ResponseRate,   RequestRate,   Request Latency avg,   Outgoing byte Rate,  IO ratio & IO wait ratio,   Record retry & error rate",
