      "updated": 1776725418333,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n Serializer\n- Retrieves and caches schemas from SR\n\nPartitioner\n- Java client uses murmur2 for hashing\n\nRecord accumulator\n- Buffer per partition, seledom used partitions may not achieve high bathing\n- if many producers are in the same JVM, memory and GC could become\nimportant\n- Sticky partioner could be used to increase batches in the case of round robin\n  (KIP-480/KIP 794)\n\n\nCompression\n - At batch level\n - Allows faster transfer to the broker\n - Reduces the inter broker replication load\n - Reduces page cache & disk space utilization on brokers\n - Gzip is more CPU intensive, Snappy is lighter, LZ4/Zstd are a good balance\n\nSender thread\n - Batches grouped by destination broker into requests\n - Multiple batches to different partitions potentially in the same producer\nrequest\n",
      "version": 1973,
      "autoResize": true,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "index": "blh",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": "o9hu2UCJ3EvuYHWRoKpkY",
      "originalText": "\n Serializer\n- Retrieves and caches schemas from SR\n\nPartitioner\n- Java client uses murmur2 for hashing\n\nRecord accumulator\n- Buffer per partition, seledom used partitions may not achieve high bathing\n- if many producers are in the same JVM, memory and GC could become important\n- Sticky partioner could be used to increase batches in the case of round robin\n  (KIP-480/KIP 794)\n\n\nCompression\n - At batch level\n - Allows faster transfer to the broker\n - Reduces the inter broker replication load\n - Reduces page cache & disk space utilization on brokers\n - Gzip is more CPU intensive, Snappy is lighter, LZ4/Zstd are a good balance\n\nSender thread\n - Batches grouped by destination broker into requests\n - Multiple batches to different partitions potentially in the same producer request\n",
      "height": 540,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
