      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776725437473,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pre-Req\nDo I understand my SLA requirements? For example:\nLatency\nThroughput -- bytes / second in and out, messages / second in and out\nMaximum message size\nFailure tolerance -- brokers, ZooKeeper, clients, data centers\nMessage delivery guarantees -- at most once, at least once, exactly once. Learn more.",
