      "autoResize": true,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "index": "blj",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pre-Req\nDo I understand my SLA requirements? For example:\nLatency\nThroughput -- bytes / second in and out, messages / second in and out\nMaximum message size\nFailure tolerance -- brokers, ZooKeeper, clients, data centers\nMessage delivery guarantees -- at most once, at least once, exactly once. Learn more.",
      "height": 175,
      "link": null,
