    {
      "seed": 904591688,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "id": "hK304Uzb1jbj3Z256rN3x",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "opacity": 100,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776725437473,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When to use - If you have a high number of partitions per broker e.g. 4,000\npartitions per broker.",
      "version": 585,
      "autoResize": false,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "bm7",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When to use - If you have a high number of partitions per broker e.g. 4,000 partitions per broker.",
      "height": 50,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "groupIds": [
        "Xufv_bOU0joIzcTv4DzpR"
      ],
      "versionNonce": 91413064,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "x": -19.781661618823364,
      "angle": 0,
      "y": 7219.3772184080535,
      "width": 744.1395263671875
    },
    {
      "seed": 533499976,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "id": "P1RUjw6nvRT8eeFIp7TE5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "opacity": 100,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776725437473,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How to set - Increment it higher until you see no noticeable improvement in\nthroughput / end-to-end latency",
      "version": 585,
      "autoResize": false,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "bm8",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How to set - Increment it higher until you see no noticeable improvement in throughput / end-to-end latency",
      "height": 50,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "groupIds": [
        "Xufv_bOU0joIzcTv4DzpR"
      ],
      "versionNonce": 1437618504,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "x": -19.781661618823364,
      "angle": 0,
      "y": 7314.3772184080535,
      "width": 733.319580078125
    },
    {
      "seed": 660817736,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "id": "jZ9N6k96w5u4csB_30TZ1",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "opacity": 100,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776725437473,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Explanation - Having too many partitions per broker has been shown to\ndrastically impact throughput. The num.replica.fetchers configuration option sets\nthe number of replica fetchers the broker will create PER other broker in the\ncluster. Meaning if we set it to two and there are two other brokers in our\ncluster our broker will spin up two fetchers for each of them for a total of four.\nThis configuration option has been shown to help reduce the impact of excessive\npartitions per broker.",
      "version": 616,
      "autoResize": false,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "bm9",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Explanation - Having too many partitions per broker has been shown to drastically impact throughput. The num.replica.fetchers configuration option sets the number of replica fetchers the broker will create PER other broker in the cluster. Meaning if we set it to two and there are two other brokers in our cluster our broker will spin up two fetchers for each of them for a total of four. This configuration option has been shown to help reduce the impact of excessive partitions per broker.",
      "height": 175,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "groupIds": [
        "Xufv_bOU0joIzcTv4DzpR"
      ],
      "versionNonce": 1294395464,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "x": -20.696854702599467,
      "angle": 0,
      "y": 7376.720139548184,
      "width": 794.3994140625
    },
