    {
      "seed": 1627013960,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "id": "XsQvTq40F2r5SHlU2AR_x",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "opacity": 100,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776725437473,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How to set - There are many ways depending on how it’s installed, but one place\nis /proc/sys/fs/file-max and it should be set to at least 200,000",
      "version": 585,
      "autoResize": false,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "bmj",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How to set - There are many ways depending on how it’s installed, but one place is /proc/sys/fs/file-max and it should be set to at least 200,000",
      "height": 50,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "groupIds": [
        "Xufv_bOU0joIzcTv4DzpR"
      ],
      "versionNonce": 966878280,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "x": -19.781661618823364,
      "angle": 0,
      "y": 10194.377218408054,
      "width": 786.51953125
    },
    {
      "seed": 2120391240,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "id": "M3-58dllmXmdFppy2nddg",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "opacity": 100,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776725437473,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Explanation - The Kafka broker creates a large number of files which it must\nkeep open at any time. By default the OS only allows 1024 per process which\nisn’t enough for a normal broker. If this limit is hit the broker will immediately\nshut down.",
      "version": 585,
      "autoResize": false,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "bmk",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Explanation - The Kafka broker creates a large number of files which it must keep open at any time. By default the OS only allows 1024 per process which isn’t enough for a normal broker. If this limit is hit the broker will immediately shut down.",
      "height": 100,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "groupIds": [
