      "locked": false,
      "text": "How to set - vm.swappiness=1",
      "version": 585,
      "autoResize": true,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "bmn",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How to set - vm.swappiness=1",
      "height": 25,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "groupIds": [
        "Xufv_bOU0joIzcTv4DzpR"
      ],
      "versionNonce": 1900609608,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "x": -19.781661618823364,
      "angle": 0,
      "y": 10586.877218408054,
      "width": 287.019775390625
    },
    {
      "seed": 1757361736,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "id": "M4M3TNSySPBcT957vf2pf",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "opacity": 100,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776725437473,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Explanation - Any data swapped to disk will require disk IO to read from in the\nfuture rather than a read from memory. This operation is in the magnitude of a\nthousand times slower and as such swapping should always be disabled for Big\nData applications. Certain OS functionality behaves poorly with vm.swappiness=0\nwhich is why we set it to the lowest value we can without setting it to zero.",
      "version": 585,
      "autoResize": false,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "bmo",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Explanation - Any data swapped to disk will require disk IO to read from in the future rather than a read from memory. This operation is in the magnitude of a thousand times slower and as such swapping should always be disabled for Big Data applications. Certain OS functionality behaves poorly with vm.swappiness=0 which is why we set it to the lowest value we can without setting it to zero.",
      "height": 125,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "groupIds": [
        "Xufv_bOU0joIzcTv4DzpR"
