      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "groupIds": [
        "Xufv_bOU0joIzcTv4DzpR"
      ],
      "versionNonce": 2051185736,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "x": -19.781661618823364,
      "angle": 0,
      "y": 10966.877218408054,
      "width": 415.31976318359375
    },
    {
      "seed": 569233992,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "id": "Yk8cHAMhQYg-Tr-9bnZWn",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "opacity": 100,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776725437473,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Explanation - The default of this value is 10 which means once 10% of the OS\nmemory is “dirty” meaning it has buffered writes intended for the disk but not\nyet written them to disk, it will begin writing them to disk. The reason we set\nthis lower is because Kafka is largely append only so we are going to be modifying\nthe same piece of data a lot before writing it out. We also want to avoid hitting\nvm.dirty_ratio at all cost, so setting this value lower can help in achieving this.",
      "version": 618,
      "autoResize": false,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "bms",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Explanation - The default of this value is 10 which means once 10% of the OS memory is “dirty” meaning it has buffered writes intended for the disk but not yet written them to disk, it will begin writing them to disk. The reason we set this lower is because Kafka is largely append only so we are going to be modifying the same piece of data a lot before writing it out. We also want to avoid hitting vm.dirty_ratio at all cost, so setting this value lower can help in achieving this.",
      "height": 150,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "groupIds": [
        "Xufv_bOU0joIzcTv4DzpR"
      ],
      "versionNonce": 1597494088,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
