      "text": "How to set - vm.dirty_ratio=80",
      "version": 585,
      "autoResize": true,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "bmv",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How to set - vm.dirty_ratio=80",
      "height": 25,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "groupIds": [
        "Xufv_bOU0joIzcTv4DzpR"
      ],
      "versionNonce": 462305352,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "x": -19.781661618823364,
      "angle": 0,
      "y": 11371.877218408054,
      "width": 307.27984619140625
    },
    {
      "seed": 820932168,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "id": "6e2EvDwsO4-4l_JyefPN9",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "opacity": 100,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776725437473,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Explanation - The default of this value is 20 which means once 20% of the OS\nmemory is “dirty” meaning it has buffered writes intended for the disk but not\nyet written them to disk, it will trigger blocking IO and wait until the data has\nbeen written to disk before continuing. We never want Kafka blocking on writing\nto disk as it is thousands of times slower than a write to memory.",
      "version": 585,
      "autoResize": false,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "bmw",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Explanation - The default of this value is 20 which means once 20% of the OS memory is “dirty” meaning it has buffered writes intended for the disk but not yet written them to disk, it will trigger blocking IO and wait until the data has been written to disk before continuing. We never want Kafka blocking on writing to disk as it is thousands of times slower than a write to memory.",
      "height": 125,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "groupIds": [
        "Xufv_bOU0joIzcTv4DzpR"
