      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776725437474,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What to Collect? To Troubleshoot\n\n- Log Files of all  components\n- System information :\n    echo $HOSTNAME\n    cat /ect_host/*release\n    cat /proc/version , cat /proc/cpuinfo,  cat /proc/meminfo\n    cat /proc/cgroups,   cat /proc/self/cgroup\n    df -h\n    mount,   vmstat 1 5 ,  iostat 1 5,  dmidecode",
      "version": 1230,
      "autoResize": true,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
