      "opacity": 100,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776725437474,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Broker Metrics for Troubleshooting\n\n Kafka emitted metrics :  TotalTimeMs,  BytesInPerSec,  BytesOutPerSec\n     kafka.server:type=SessionExpireListener, name=ZookeeperExpirePerSec\n\n Host-level metrics :   page cache reads ratio,  DISK usage, CPU usage, Network bytes\nsend/received\n\n  JVM GC Metrics:   java.lang:type=GarbageCollector, name-G1 Young| Old Generation\n      - CollectionCount, CollectionTime",
      "version": 728,
      "autoResize": true,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "bnv",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": "vkRKlKUeM5_1K92SC31Xg",
      "originalText": "Broker Metrics for Troubleshooting\n\n Kafka emitted metrics :  TotalTimeMs,  BytesInPerSec,  BytesOutPerSec\n     kafka.server:type=SessionExpireListener, name=ZookeeperExpirePerSec\n\n Host-level metrics :   page cache reads ratio,  DISK usage, CPU usage, Network bytes send/received\n\n  JVM GC Metrics:   java.lang:type=GarbageCollector, name-G1 Young| Old Generation\n      - CollectionCount, CollectionTime",
