    {
      "seed": 58837816,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "id": "8L1K4FreRnXCyYW_9cJyx",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "opacity": 100,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776724278515,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Build \"dirty map\" from more recent, uncleaned log segments.\n    - Active log segment is never cleaned.\n2. Create a copy of each clean segment, remove any keys\nexisting in the dirty map.\n3. Switch the segment pointer to a new copy\n4. Store the clean offset in the cleaner-offset-checkpoint file\n5. Segments are merged if they get too small ",
      "version": 890,
      "autoResize": true,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "btd",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": "Vr7UJmqkBMEZxxv27xOEe",
      "originalText": "1. Build \"dirty map\" from more recent, uncleaned log segments.\n    - Active log segment is never cleaned.\n2. Create a copy of each clean segment, remove any keys existing in the dirty map.\n3. Switch the segment pointer to a new copy\n4. Store the clean offset in the cleaner-offset-checkpoint file\n5. Segments are merged if they get too small ",
      "height": 175,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "groupIds": [
        "oBbv6D0-ajqzR8MjiarAa"
      ],
      "versionNonce": 1938560840,
      "textAlign": "left",
