    {
      "seed": 1974359368,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "id": "zLDQFTEyzRyudoXEo21uo",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "opacity": 100,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "updated": 1776727232558,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Consumers and Offsets\n- Each message in Partition has offset.\n- Kafka tracks consumer offset.\n- Offset for each triple ( group.id, tropic, partition) is tracked.\n- Offsets tracked in topic (__consumer_offsets)\n- Consumer offsets auto-committed by default  \n- Consumer offset refers to next message to read",
      "version": 440,
      "autoResize": true,
      "type": "text",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "index": "buo",
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": "ahW-e-5cBfFLYgDL2ch9S",
      "originalText": "Consumers and Offsets\n- Each message in Partition has offset.\n- Kafka tracks consumer offset.\n- Offset for each triple ( group.id, tropic, partition) is tracked.\n- Offsets tracked in topic (__consumer_offsets)\n- Consumer offsets auto-committed by default  \n- Consumer offset refers to next message to read",
      "height": 140,
      "link": null,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "groupIds": [
        "XkqhhE9tug7xpgAwVlZAY"
      ],
      "versionNonce": 1556385848,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "frameId": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "x": 4624.436661864649,
      "angle": 0,
      "y": -1042.7192644158795,
      "width": 494.9275207519531
