      "originalText": "Manually Committing offsets.\n- Set : enable.auto.commit=false\n-  Synchronous:\n    CommitSync(),  blocks until success or excpetion.\n     At most once:\n\n     At least once: \n- Asynchronous:\n    - commitAsync(),  Non-blocking,  Optional:  Add callback.\n    - Higher Throughput,   Delayed notification about failure",
